@startuml 31-validation
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction
title boussole-format — checking a whole course (validate, validate.rule, source)

class SubjectInspector <<entry point>>
class DiagnosticCollector <<diagnostic>>
class Course <<model>>
package "validate" {
  class Validator <<composite>> {
    +{static} standard() : Validator
    +validate(ValidationContext, DiagnosticCollector)
  }
  interface ValidationRule {
    +check(ValidationContext, DiagnosticCollector)
  }
  class ValidationContext <<record>> {
    videos : Optional<VideoCatalog>
  }
  interface VideoCatalog {
    +exists(youtubeId) : boolean
  }
  package "validate.rule" {
    class DuplicateIdRule <<F003>>
    class IdSyntaxRule <<F004>>
    class SessionIdMatchRule <<F010>>
    class MissingSessionFileRule <<F011>>
    class McqChoicesRule <<F022>>
    class FillGapsRule <<F023>>
    class ReferenceRule <<F030>>
    class ReferenceOrderRule <<F042>>
    class SourceFileRule <<F031>>
    class SourceInventoryRule <<F033-F036>>
    class SourceProvenanceRule <<F039>>
    class AuthorshipRule <<P012>>
    class VideoExistsRule <<F032>>
    class NotionExerciseRule <<P001>>
    class SingleExampleRule <<P002>>
    class PartOrderRule <<P003>>
    class HintPresenceRule <<P004>>
    class DeclaredTermsRule <<P005>>
    class ClosingRule <<P006>>
    class QuickCheckRule <<P007>>
    class TimedSessionFitRule <<P008>>
    class TimedSessionContentRule <<P009>>
    class McqFeedbackRule <<P010>>
    class "CourseIds, LessonNotions, LexiconTermResolver,\nIdSeen, TimedSessions" as RuleHelpers <<helpers>>
  }
}

package "source" {
  interface SourceDocuments {
    +exists(file) : boolean
    +pageCount(file) : OptionalInt
    +documents() : List<String>
    +sha256(file) : Optional<String>
  }
  class FolderSourceDocuments
  class SourceInventory <<helpers>> {
    +{static} compare(sources, documents) : List<SourceState>
    +{static} duplicates(sources, documents) : List<List<String>>
  }
}


SubjectInspector --> Validator
SubjectInspector ..> FolderSourceDocuments : creates
ValidationContext --> Course : course
Validator o-- "*" ValidationRule : rules
ValidationRule ..> ValidationContext : reads
ValidationContext --> SourceDocuments : sources
ValidationContext --> VideoCatalog : videos
SourceDocuments <|.. FolderSourceDocuments
ValidationRule <|.. DuplicateIdRule
ValidationRule <|.. IdSyntaxRule
ValidationRule <|.. SessionIdMatchRule
ValidationRule <|.. MissingSessionFileRule
ValidationRule <|.. McqChoicesRule
ValidationRule <|.. FillGapsRule
ValidationRule <|.. ReferenceRule
ValidationRule <|.. ReferenceOrderRule
ValidationRule <|.. SourceFileRule
ValidationRule <|.. SourceInventoryRule
ValidationRule <|.. SourceProvenanceRule
ValidationRule <|.. AuthorshipRule
SourceInventoryRule ..> SourceInventory
ValidationRule <|.. VideoExistsRule
ValidationRule <|.. NotionExerciseRule
ValidationRule <|.. SingleExampleRule
ValidationRule <|.. PartOrderRule
ValidationRule <|.. HintPresenceRule
ValidationRule <|.. DeclaredTermsRule
ValidationRule <|.. ClosingRule
ValidationRule <|.. QuickCheckRule
ValidationRule <|.. TimedSessionFitRule
ValidationRule <|.. TimedSessionContentRule
ValidationRule <|.. McqFeedbackRule
ValidationRule ..> DiagnosticCollector : reports
ValidationRule ..> DiagnosticCollector : reports
note bottom of RuleHelpers
  Errors a file shows on its own are
  reported while it is read (load, parse);
  the rules check what needs the whole course.
end note

package "version" {
  class TrackVersions <<F040, F041>> {
    +{static} compare(reference, version) : List<Diagnostic>
  }
}
TrackVersions ..> Diagnostic : sessions, notions, questions

@enduml
